 ygen to the body. How we breathe can have profound effects on our mind\, b
 ody\, and spirit.\n\nIn this noontime webinar\, we will discuss the mind/b
 ody connection of breathing and learn how habitual breathing patterns and 
 responses to stress can increase symptoms like anxiety\, abdominal discomf
